mydotfiles shortcuts — run: dots

Git aliases (git <alias>)
  st status     co checkout   sw switch   br branch
  ci commit     last          lg graph    amend

Fuzzy git
  gsw   fzf + git switch
  gco   fzf + git checkout

fzf (Linux/WSL)
  Ctrl-R  history    Ctrl-T  file    Alt-C  directory

Navigation
  z <query>   zoxide jump
  zi          zoxide interactive

Search
  rg <pat>    ripgrep (smart-case, hidden; skips .git)
  fd <pat>    find files (gitignore-aware)

Git pager
  delta       used automatically via gitconfig

Editor / pager
  $EDITOR     preferred-editor (Cursor → Antigravity → VS Code → nvim/vim/vi)
  PAGER       less -FRX when available

SSH
  setup-ssh [--gh] [--gl] [--copy host] [--identity path]

Bootstrap
  ./bootstrap.sh | .\bootstrap.ps1   [-Ssh|--ssh] [-SkipWsl]
